const STRICT_TRANSLATIONS={"de": {"ACCOUNT": "KONTO", "Drivers": "Fahrer", "Trucks": "Lkw", "Loads": "Ladungen", "Warehouses": "Lager", "Verification": "Verifizierung", "Selfie": "Selfie", "NEGOTIATION": "VERHANDLUNG", "FOUNDER": "GRÜNDER", "USA": "USA", "Europe": "Europa", "TUT Move is being built as a multi-country, multi-language marketplace connecting transportation and storage capacity with demand — starting with drivers, trucks, loads and warehouses.": "TUT Move wird als länder- und sprachübergreifender Marktplatz aufgebaut, der Transport- und Lagerkapazitäten mit Nachfrage verbindet — beginnend mit Fahrern, Lkw, Ladungen und Lagern.", "At the same moment a business is searching for a driver, a driver may have available time. A load may be waiting for a truck while a nearby truck has unused capacity. Warehouse space can sit empty while another business is searching for storage.": "Während ein Unternehmen einen Fahrer sucht, kann gleichzeitig ein Fahrer freie Kapazität haben. Eine Ladung wartet vielleicht auf einen Lkw, während ein Lkw in der Nähe ungenutzte Kapazität hat. Lagerfläche kann leer stehen, während ein anderes Unternehmen genau diese Fläche sucht.", "Every category works both ways. A driver can offer time or search for a truck. A truck can be listed as available or requested. Warehouse capacity can be offered or searched. The market decides the commercial terms.": "Jede Kategorie funktioniert in beide Richtungen. Ein Fahrer kann Zeit anbieten oder einen Lkw suchen. Ein Lkw kann als verfügbar eingestellt oder gesucht werden. Lagerkapazität kann angeboten oder gesucht werden. Der Markt bestimmt die Geschäftsbedingungen.", "“I asked myself a simple question: how can one business be searching for a driver while somewhere else a driver is looking for work? How can a truck be empty while a load is searching for a truck? How can warehouse space sit unused while another business needs that exact capacity? The resources and the demand already exist — they are fragmented. TUT Move started with the idea of bringing them into one market.”": "„Ich stellte mir eine einfache Frage: Wie kann ein Unternehmen einen Fahrer suchen, während anderswo ein Fahrer Arbeit sucht? Wie kann ein Lkw leer sein, während eine Ladung einen Lkw sucht? Wie kann Lagerfläche ungenutzt bleiben, während ein anderes Unternehmen genau diese Kapazität benötigt? Ressourcen und Nachfrage existieren bereits — sie sind nur voneinander getrennt. TUT Move entstand aus der Idee, sie in einem Markt zusammenzubringen.“", "tutmove.com · Turn Unused Into Transport": "tutmove.com · Ungenutztes in Transport verwandeln", "Offer available capacity on your own terms.": "Bieten Sie verfügbare Kapazität zu Ihren eigenen Bedingungen an.", "Describe what you need and let the market respond.": "Beschreiben Sie Ihren Bedarf und lassen Sie den Markt reagieren.", "Offer, counter, accept. TUT Move does not set the market price.": "Anbieten, gegenbieten, annehmen. TUT Move legt den Marktpreis nicht fest.", "Open listing": "Offenes Inserat", "Closed": "Geschlossen", "Verified": "Verifiziert", "Review required": "Prüfung erforderlich", "Rejected": "Abgelehnt", "Price": "Preis", "Currency": "Währung", "Country": "Land", "Status": "Status", "Role": "Rolle", "Roles": "Rollen", "User": "Nutzer", "Users": "Nutzer", "Listings": "Inserate", "Bookings": "Buchungen", "Revenue": "Umsatz", "Fee": "Gebühr", "Search": "Suchen", "Filter": "Filtern", "Clear": "Zurücksetzen", "Save": "Speichern", "Cancel": "Abbrechen", "Continue": "Weiter", "Back": "Zurück", "Submit": "Absenden", "Upload": "Hochladen", "Choose file": "Datei auswählen", "Create account": "Konto erstellen", "Already have an account?": "Sie haben bereits ein Konto?", "No account yet?": "Noch kein Konto?", "Verification status": "Verifizierungsstatus"}, "ar": {"ACCOUNT": "الحساب", "Drivers": "السائقون", "Trucks": "الشاحنات", "Loads": "الحمولات", "Warehouses": "المخازن", "Verification": "التحقق", "Selfie": "الصورة الشخصية", "NEGOTIATION": "التفاوض", "FOUNDER": "المؤسس", "USA": "الولايات المتحدة", "Europe": "أوروبا", "TUT Move is being built as a multi-country, multi-language marketplace connecting transportation and storage capacity with demand — starting with drivers, trucks, loads and warehouses.": "يتم بناء TUT Move كسوق متعدد الدول واللغات يربط قدرات النقل والتخزين بالطلب، بدءًا من السائقين والشاحنات والحمولات والمخازن.", "At the same moment a business is searching for a driver, a driver may have available time. A load may be waiting for a truck while a nearby truck has unused capacity. Warehouse space can sit empty while another business is searching for storage.": "في نفس الوقت الذي تبحث فيه شركة عن سائق، قد يكون هناك سائق لديه وقت متاح. وقد تنتظر حمولة شاحنة بينما توجد شاحنة قريبة بسعة غير مستخدمة. وقد تبقى مساحة مخزن فارغة بينما تبحث شركة أخرى عن تخزين.", "Every category works both ways. A driver can offer time or search for a truck. A truck can be listed as available or requested. Warehouse capacity can be offered or searched. The market decides the commercial terms.": "كل فئة تعمل في الاتجاهين. يمكن للسائق عرض وقته أو البحث عن شاحنة. ويمكن عرض الشاحنة كمتاحة أو طلب شاحنة. ويمكن عرض سعة المخزن أو البحث عنها. والسوق هو الذي يحدد الشروط التجارية.", "“I asked myself a simple question: how can one business be searching for a driver while somewhere else a driver is looking for work? How can a truck be empty while a load is searching for a truck? How can warehouse space sit unused while another business needs that exact capacity? The resources and the demand already exist — they are fragmented. TUT Move started with the idea of bringing them into one market.”": "«سألت نفسي سؤالًا بسيطًا: كيف يمكن لشركة أن تبحث عن سائق بينما يوجد في مكان آخر سائق يبحث عن عمل؟ كيف يمكن أن تكون شاحنة فارغة بينما توجد حمولة تبحث عن شاحنة؟ وكيف يمكن أن تبقى مساحة مخزن غير مستخدمة بينما تحتاج شركة أخرى إلى هذه السعة نفسها؟ الموارد والطلب موجودان بالفعل، لكنهما متفرقَان. بدأت فكرة TUT Move من جمعهما في سوق واحد.»", "tutmove.com · Turn Unused Into Transport": "tutmove.com · حوّل غير المستغل إلى نقل", "Offer available capacity on your own terms.": "اعرض السعة المتاحة بشروطك أنت.", "Describe what you need and let the market respond.": "صف ما تحتاجه ودع السوق يستجيب.", "Offer, counter, accept. TUT Move does not set the market price.": "قدّم عرضًا أو عرضًا مضادًا ثم اتفق. TUT Move لا تحدد سعر السوق.", "Open listing": "إعلان مفتوح", "Closed": "مغلق", "Verified": "موثّق", "Review required": "يتطلب مراجعة", "Rejected": "مرفوض", "Price": "السعر", "Currency": "العملة", "Country": "الدولة", "Status": "الحالة", "Role": "الدور", "Roles": "الأدوار", "User": "المستخدم", "Users": "المستخدمون", "Listings": "الإعلانات", "Bookings": "الحجوزات", "Revenue": "الإيرادات", "Fee": "الرسوم", "Search": "بحث", "Filter": "تصفية", "Clear": "مسح", "Save": "حفظ", "Cancel": "إلغاء", "Continue": "متابعة", "Back": "رجوع", "Submit": "إرسال", "Upload": "رفع", "Choose file": "اختر ملفًا", "Create account": "إنشاء حساب", "Already have an account?": "لديك حساب بالفعل؟", "No account yet?": "ليس لديك حساب بعد؟", "Verification status": "حالة التحقق"}, "fr": {"ACCOUNT": "COMPTE", "Drivers": "Chauffeurs", "Trucks": "Camions", "Loads": "Chargements", "Warehouses": "Entrepôts", "Verification": "Vérification", "Selfie": "Selfie", "NEGOTIATION": "NÉGOCIATION", "FOUNDER": "FONDATEUR", "USA": "États-Unis", "Europe": "Europe", "TUT Move is being built as a multi-country, multi-language marketplace connecting transportation and storage capacity with demand — starting with drivers, trucks, loads and warehouses.": "TUT Move est conçu comme une place de marché multinationale et multilingue reliant les capacités de transport et de stockage à la demande, en commençant par les chauffeurs, camions, chargements et entrepôts.", "At the same moment a business is searching for a driver, a driver may have available time. A load may be waiting for a truck while a nearby truck has unused capacity. Warehouse space can sit empty while another business is searching for storage.": "Au même moment où une entreprise cherche un chauffeur, un chauffeur peut avoir du temps disponible. Un chargement peut attendre un camion alors qu’un camion proche dispose d’une capacité inutilisée. Un espace d’entrepôt peut rester vide alors qu’une autre entreprise cherche du stockage.", "Every category works both ways. A driver can offer time or search for a truck. A truck can be listed as available or requested. Warehouse capacity can be offered or searched. The market decides the commercial terms.": "Chaque catégorie fonctionne dans les deux sens. Un chauffeur peut proposer son temps ou chercher un camion. Un camion peut être proposé ou recherché. Une capacité d’entrepôt peut être offerte ou recherchée. Le marché détermine les conditions commerciales.", "“I asked myself a simple question: how can one business be searching for a driver while somewhere else a driver is looking for work? How can a truck be empty while a load is searching for a truck? How can warehouse space sit unused while another business needs that exact capacity? The resources and the demand already exist — they are fragmented. TUT Move started with the idea of bringing them into one market.”": "« Je me suis posé une question simple : comment une entreprise peut-elle chercher un chauffeur alors qu’ailleurs un chauffeur cherche du travail ? Comment un camion peut-il être vide alors qu’un chargement cherche un camion ? Comment un espace d’entrepôt peut-il rester inutilisé alors qu’une autre entreprise a besoin exactement de cette capacité ? Les ressources et la demande existent déjà, mais elles sont fragmentées. TUT Move est né de l’idée de les réunir sur un seul marché. »", "tutmove.com · Turn Unused Into Transport": "tutmove.com · Transformer l’inutilisé en transport", "Offer available capacity on your own terms.": "Proposez une capacité disponible selon vos conditions.", "Describe what you need and let the market respond.": "Décrivez votre besoin et laissez le marché répondre.", "Offer, counter, accept. TUT Move does not set the market price.": "Offre, contre-offre, acceptation. TUT Move ne fixe pas le prix du marché.", "Open listing": "Annonce ouverte", "Closed": "Fermé", "Verified": "Vérifié", "Review required": "Révision requise", "Rejected": "Rejeté", "Price": "Prix", "Currency": "Devise", "Country": "Pays", "Status": "Statut", "Role": "Rôle", "Roles": "Rôles", "User": "Utilisateur", "Users": "Utilisateurs", "Listings": "Annonces", "Bookings": "Réservations", "Revenue": "Revenus", "Fee": "Frais", "Search": "Rechercher", "Filter": "Filtrer", "Clear": "Effacer", "Save": "Enregistrer", "Cancel": "Annuler", "Continue": "Continuer", "Back": "Retour", "Submit": "Envoyer", "Upload": "Téléverser", "Choose file": "Choisir un fichier", "Create account": "Créer un compte", "Already have an account?": "Vous avez déjà un compte ?", "No account yet?": "Pas encore de compte ?", "Verification status": "Statut de vérification"}, "es": {"ACCOUNT": "CUENTA", "Drivers": "Conductores", "Trucks": "Camiones", "Loads": "Cargas", "Warehouses": "Almacenes", "Verification": "Verificación", "Selfie": "Selfie", "NEGOTIATION": "NEGOCIACIÓN", "FOUNDER": "FUNDADOR", "USA": "Estados Unidos", "Europe": "Europa", "TUT Move is being built as a multi-country, multi-language marketplace connecting transportation and storage capacity with demand — starting with drivers, trucks, loads and warehouses.": "TUT Move se está construyendo como un mercado multinacional y multilingüe que conecta la capacidad de transporte y almacenamiento con la demanda, empezando por conductores, camiones, cargas y almacenes.", "At the same moment a business is searching for a driver, a driver may have available time. A load may be waiting for a truck while a nearby truck has unused capacity. Warehouse space can sit empty while another business is searching for storage.": "Mientras una empresa busca un conductor, puede haber un conductor con tiempo disponible. Una carga puede estar esperando un camión mientras un camión cercano tiene capacidad sin usar. Un espacio de almacén puede estar vacío mientras otra empresa busca almacenamiento.", "Every category works both ways. A driver can offer time or search for a truck. A truck can be listed as available or requested. Warehouse capacity can be offered or searched. The market decides the commercial terms.": "Cada categoría funciona en ambos sentidos. Un conductor puede ofrecer su tiempo o buscar un camión. Un camión puede publicarse como disponible o solicitarse. La capacidad de almacén puede ofrecerse o buscarse. El mercado decide las condiciones comerciales.", "“I asked myself a simple question: how can one business be searching for a driver while somewhere else a driver is looking for work? How can a truck be empty while a load is searching for a truck? How can warehouse space sit unused while another business needs that exact capacity? The resources and the demand already exist — they are fragmented. TUT Move started with the idea of bringing them into one market.”": "«Me hice una pregunta sencilla: ¿cómo puede una empresa estar buscando un conductor mientras en otro lugar un conductor busca trabajo? ¿Cómo puede un camión estar vacío mientras una carga busca un camión? ¿Cómo puede un espacio de almacén quedar sin uso mientras otra empresa necesita exactamente esa capacidad? Los recursos y la demanda ya existen, pero están fragmentados. TUT Move nació con la idea de reunirlos en un solo mercado.»", "tutmove.com · Turn Unused Into Transport": "tutmove.com · Convierte lo no utilizado en transporte", "Offer available capacity on your own terms.": "Ofrece capacidad disponible bajo tus propias condiciones.", "Describe what you need and let the market respond.": "Describe lo que necesitas y deja que el mercado responda.", "Offer, counter, accept. TUT Move does not set the market price.": "Oferta, contraoferta y aceptación. TUT Move no fija el precio de mercado.", "Open listing": "Anuncio abierto", "Closed": "Cerrado", "Verified": "Verificado", "Review required": "Revisión necesaria", "Rejected": "Rechazado", "Price": "Precio", "Currency": "Moneda", "Country": "País", "Status": "Estado", "Role": "Rol", "Roles": "Roles", "User": "Usuario", "Users": "Usuarios", "Listings": "Anuncios", "Bookings": "Reservas", "Revenue": "Ingresos", "Fee": "Comisión", "Search": "Buscar", "Filter": "Filtrar", "Clear": "Limpiar", "Save": "Guardar", "Cancel": "Cancelar", "Continue": "Continuar", "Back": "Atrás", "Submit": "Enviar", "Upload": "Subir", "Choose file": "Elegir archivo", "Create account": "Crear cuenta", "Already have an account?": "¿Ya tienes una cuenta?", "No account yet?": "¿Aún no tienes una cuenta?", "Verification status": "Estado de verificación"}};
